{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "librarian-title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 20,
      "y": -200,
      "width": 5780,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "# Proposed to-be source enrichment\n**Symptom:** Current source stages return recorded statuses without an independent verdict on every required derived output.\n**Root cause:** Preserve the nine-stage evidence contract while assigning semantic work and independent judgment to the proposed agent roles.\nLanes are actors; red arrows are extensions (numbered); red ends are ways the use case ends without success; orange cards call another use case. Generated from `proposed-source-enrichment.spec.yaml`."
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-s",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 140,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 70,
      "text": "● start",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-boundary",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 340,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "Proposed child of the mixed dispatcher for one selected Source. Inherits its Lead, Core-stored specification, grants and ledger; returns to that caller. No second worker or commission.",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Lead (tier 1)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-bind",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3640,
      "y": 540,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "**1.** binds the selected Source and required outputs to the admitted parent specification, current hashes, role assignments, grants and exact receipt keys",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Core"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-dwork",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3640,
      "y": 740,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "◇ an admitted Source item is selected?",
      "color": "5",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Core"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-controls",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3640,
      "y": 1140,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "**2.** applies the existing worker controls and proposed dispatch grants: cancellation, writer state, attempts, known spend and recorded allowance; checks critical flags at every dispatch and commit",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Core"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-enowork",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5440,
      "y": 940,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "◉ no Source item admitted; the parent retains all mixed work and outstanding decisions\n*outcome: reused*",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-dcontrols",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3640,
      "y": 1340,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "◇ recorded controls permit this work?",
      "color": "5",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Core"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-validate",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3640,
      "y": 2340,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "**3.** validate: checks evidence, source identity, source/artifact/recipe/route compatibility and matching task receipts; completed work still gets fresh publication admission",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Core"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-paused_at_72362cad54",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 1540,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "returns a pause checkpoint and the exact continuation or reserved authority needed to the parent; reuses already granted authority without asking again",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Lead (tier 1)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-escalated_at_a2bce665b2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 1740,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "returns unresolved cause, evidence, retained work and intervention needed to the parent; code changes or exhausted/no-progress repairs are not silent retries",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Lead (tier 1)"
      }
    },
    {
